"terminal runs as root (for example sudo or su) or connects to another "
"computer (ssh, mosh)."
msgstr ""

#: src/com.aripd.Pano.gschema.xml:992
msgid ""
"Whether new tabs and panes start in the container of the terminal they are "
"opened from"
msgstr ""

#: src/com.aripd.Pano.gschema.xml:993
msgid ""
"Works for Toolbox and Distrobox containers. The shell inside the container "
"has to report it (Toolbox does), or the terminal has to be started in it "
"from Pano Terminal."
msgstr ""

#: src/com.aripd.Pano.gschema.xml:998
msgid ""
"Whether to reopen the windows, tabs and panes of the last session on startup"
msgstr ""

#: src/com.aripd.Pano.gschema.xml:999
msgid ""
"Applies when Pano Terminal is started without arguments and no window is "
"open. Each terminal gets a new shell in its previous working directory; "
"running programs are not restored."
msgstr ""

